-- ============================================================================
-- 216 - Strip self-scaling phantom Increase-X tags (2026-08-01). Verify-from-source
-- SWEEP: 35 approved [Increase X] buff tags across 26 champions whose skill text
-- has NO placed [Increase X] ALLY buff - each was scraped from self-scaling passive
-- prose ("increases THIS CHAMPION's <stat> by ..."), an individual self-buff that is
-- excluded by design (Mike, 2026-08-01). Same class as seed 215 (Artak).
-- Detection: no [Increase <stat>] bracket (spelling-tolerant DEF/Defense/Defence,
-- SPD/Speed, etc.) + a literal "increase(s) this Champion's <stat>" sentence + no
-- ally-buff bracket. Ambiguous rows (ally flat-stat auras like Gurptuk/The Incarnate,
-- enemy-stat mis-scrapes like Krok'mar) were HELD for human review, not rejected here.
-- Soft-reject (status='rejected'); code consumes only 'approved'. Policy #18 worksheet
-- DB_Champion_Tags write-back OWED (no worksheet access this session).
-- ============================================================================
